{"v":4,"catch":"強大的不朽巨龍傳說","desc":"“DRAGON SABER”是 NAMCO（Bandai Namco Entertainment Inc.）於 1990 年發行的射擊遊戲。該標題允許玩家通過不觸碰射擊按鈕來進行強力射擊，以及切換到各種其他帶有變更物品的龍。 使用這些來通過階段並擊敗BOSS！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2022-07-14","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ed640da72d117b76b405c966e992f960983d566402415aa9cc29348dd43575df.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5ad3a1cf9235a47e225baad3b3fa6e0951b0521a85839f163657ea757bd71266.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/699ac4a47ea1bab644fb2f093bbb7581fe5a916b838f159f1b1922d36da899c8.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6e2cf429540770c4e13914e35ec06d784290cd43b58bb2328e9ac3d3c19a0831.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ad9930b23cf4655e7d73f08848336e8e21dc178c117013eb559e0baa65907958.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/25015681626a679b8e45d32dfe60d70f3922513277afb17aaeff08e6ab7aa8bd.jpg"],"titleId":"010060001833a000","dlc":[]}